  "declaredIdentity": "tenant/type-ii-periods/periodId, supplied stable minted ID; Start compares exact plan/opening, but uses mutable current actor fields. Other commands vary: generationKey exact compares intent; approval/amendment recognize latest intent, close snapshots use stable IDs; no uniform historical request intent.",
  "invariant": "One period binds exact approved opening plan/population; close must reconcile the approved expected population, independently acknowledge all unresolved material items, and freeze the same approved sources. Close amendments preserve original expected population/acknowledgements and chain exact changed sources.",
  "boundaryDecision": "narrow",
  "boundaryRationale": "The immutable approved expected-population manifest is a legitimate value proof for close, not a live roster of occurrence children. Keep a narrow period close/lineage owner; move occurrence-generation process/batches and immutable close snapshots/history out of active state. Preserve canonical frozen manifest and current closure lineage digest so atomic close rules remain exact.",
